<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>ALL I WANT IS YOU</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">The Kid LAROI</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">ALL I WANT IS YOU</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">77Fi5t6oOR6mdAHD2WA08Z</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.820" end="00:18.033">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.033" end="00:26.033">All I want is you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.907" end="00:34.907">All I want is you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.338" end="00:37.838" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.516" end="00:38.016">[Verse]</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.740" end="00:44.740">I understand our plan will take some time (Time, time, time, time, time)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.632" end="00:54.632">There ain't no rush, our fate is intertwined (Uh, 'wined, 'wined, 'wined, 'wined, 'wined)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.782" end="00:56.282" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.080" end="00:56.580">[Pre-Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.827" end="00:58.482">'Cause first time you looked at me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.482" end="01:01.145">I knew you were already mine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.145" end="01:03.358">With me in every past life</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.358" end="01:05.688">Destined to be by my side</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.688" end="01:07.983">'Cause when I look in your eyes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.983" end="01:10.290">I see the rest of my lifе</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.290" end="01:14.023">There's no one еlse left to find, 'cause</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.023" end="01:15.523" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.201" end="01:15.701">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.343" end="01:22.343">All I want is you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.885" end="01:30.885">All I want is you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.110" end="01:34.610" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.300" end="01:34.800">[Post-Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.578" end="01:37.654">There's not a thing anybody could say</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.654" end="01:39.840">That would drive me away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.840" end="01:42.243">Give it all I can take</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.243" end="01:50.243">All I want is you, oh-oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.862" end="01:59.862">[Outro]</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.906" end="02:05.906" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(You)</p></div></body></tt>